# SPACExPRO Hackathon — environment variable names (NO values)
#
# App configuration (event dates, limits, weights, contact email, fee,
# WhatsApp number) lives in the database `settings` table and is edited
# in the Organizer area — it does NOT come from environment variables.
# The one exception is Razorpay: server/src/razorpay.ts (the single
# Razorpay integration point) reads its three variables from the
# environment only. Never commit real values.

# Node/Bun environment name (e.g. production)
NODE_ENV=

# Standalone local server (all optional — defaults shown in comments)
# PORT=3000
# HOST=localhost   (set HOST=0.0.0.0 to open the site on a phone on the same Wi-Fi)
# DATABASE_PATH=   (defaults to app.db in the project folder)

# Razorpay
# Set all three in the hosting environment to enable Razorpay.
# Until all three are set, payments use the manual UTR flow and show
# "Pending Verification". See README.md — "Integrating Razorpay".
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
